      "text_raw": "On the left, the Bode dia-\ngram is given of the open-\nand closed-loop gain. It\nshows what the output volt-\nage is for a small input volt-\nage, which increases in\nfrequency.\nOn the right, the voltage\nis added at the intermediate\npoint. It shows that at low\nfrequencies the gain of the\nfirst stage decreases. It is fol-\nlowed by a low-pass filter,\nwith a pole equal to the\ndominant pole of the\nopamp. The gain across the\noutput stage is constant.",
      "text": "On the left, the Bode diagram is given of the openand closed-loop gain. It shows what the output voltage is for a small input voltage, which increases in frequency. On the right, the voltage is added at the intermediate point. It shows that at low frequencies the gain of the first stage decreases. It is followed by a low-pass filter, with a pole equal to the dominant pole of the opamp. The gain across the output stage is constant."
